{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "56f1bd59e5768324e33b86d402045e94a566eac3cbfa502f791335ef8a9dbaaf", "ja": "（今日はロコと、鯉のぼり祭りのポスター撮影に\n来たんだけど……ふと気付くと、ロコが消えていた！）", "zh": "（今天我和ROCO来拍摄鲤鱼旗祭典的海报……\n一回神却发现ROCO不见了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6b2702e84d7db8bab9dfb36a05b4edac4b6250c861ca9f0f653fbde951b27a4a", "ja": "困ったな、もうすぐ撮影が始まるのに。\n連絡も取れないし……。", "zh": "伤脑筋，拍摄快要开始了，\n却联络不上人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "8a6a81bfffb191cb889e1da987c55a63ea77c98517f8c316bc481a525d8dd431", "ja": "{$P$}？\n何かハプニングがありましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n发生了什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "439c6e95545fbe05750a18451dc37e53a410561f2e5006a0fb1b3652e7bca56e", "ja": "あ、ロコ！　ハプニングがありましたか、じゃなくて、\nダメじゃないか、急にいなくなったりしたら……。", "zh": "啊，ROCO！你怎么还有心情这样问，\n你不能突然不见人影啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "7cac9207876445fb5991a6eeab0f09deed15f40305808c35299e52218c5d5ea0", "ja": "あっ、ソーリーです！\n言ったつもりで、忘れてました……。", "zh": "啊，Sorry！\n原本要跟你说，后来却忘了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e24ac44193dc85f46d61dd9fd39a6f8f20ce50f9af3b46249af645985d7eea53", "ja": "まあ、戻ってきてくれてホッとしたけど……\nところで、何をしてたんだ？", "zh": "好啦，看到你回来我也松了一口气……\n话说回来，你跑去哪了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "aaaaff3fe8419d47b767ad5b302de71a73bc0dac922177f019068f37107cdf65", "ja": "はい！　スタッフの中に、こいのぼりフェスタの\nオーガナイザーがいたので、ヒアリングしてきました。", "zh": "喔！因为工作人员中有鲤鱼旗Festival的Organizer，\n所以ROCO去Hearing了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "d76f998a458ea705401da57b3719cc4de8b24b406b5c61be5fedaa142cdd56d1", "ja": "それから、オペレーションスタッフのメンバーと、\nエキストラのローカルチルドレンと……。", "zh": "然后和Operation Staff的成员，\n还有担任临演的Local children……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0297c38e072193caa0c7deea091147cbe79cfe8bb6847dacb30c11a5de6453ef", "ja": "ヒアリング……って、何を？", "zh": "Hearing……Hearing什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "c8cdc4b79d692d664451e329ee14770796b2748f9147086d0f62b12a47f17f48", "ja": "ロコは今回、ポスターのモデルだけじゃなくて、\nデザインもまかせてもらいましたから！", "zh": "因为ROCO这次不仅要当海报的Model，\n还要负责Design！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "cdb63ec201b9e458f010ff2ae2b92ab52e88051c2c05ea51f627cdc9537dcdbf", "ja": "ロコ的には、アートって、\nストーリーやヒストリーが大切だと思ってるんです。", "zh": "对ROCO来说，\nArt当中非常重要的就是Story和History。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "48f4dbb8077146d25f7cb00fa2115da7654d7c0c58de5b03b072084fe238a00f", "ja": "トラディショナルなフェスティバルほど、\nそういうことがインポータントになってくるんですよ！", "zh": "越是Traditional的Festival，\n这两点就会越Important！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "138ab8aa3bfbf407661a97a3154d79c47f8351c0e70555a7c770884f3c178b62", "ja": "ええと、つまり……いいポスターにするために、\nお祭りの歴史や情報を集めていた、って感じか。", "zh": "呃，也就是说……为了让海报成品更棒，\n你去搜集了祭典的历史和资料是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "f355f573298333b7b5b129b23cd224e3bf77b024ed67931005c75d786cda58cb", "ja": "イグザクトリーです、{$P$}♪\nなので、撮影の前に行ってきたんですよ！", "zh": "Exactly，{$P$}♪\n所以ROCO才在拍摄之前去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "ab8ca1ca4dd8d9ed5f279c623a7eff50175509c58404ba55a0e5cb5221281a53", "ja": "せっかくのリクエストですけど、ロコは、\nこいのぼりには、あまり詳しくありませんし……。", "zh": "难得接到这样的Request，\nROCO却对鲤鱼旗不太熟悉，所以才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "90f576563ba080a543c18ac5d41b980be7b68573acb003966d39818d2d3e568f", "ja": "でも、{$P$}に言わないで\n行ってしまって、ソーリーでした……。", "zh": "但没跟{$P$}说一声就跑去，\n真是Sorry……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6c7103912f7d8848127c06b31e9de1f528e314a05cc418a265f32642a556382f", "ja": "うん、次からは気を付けてくれ。\n真剣に取り組んでくれるのは、嬉しいけどな！", "zh": "嗯，下次要多注意。\n不过看到你这么认真投入，我也很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "d7e4ffdc4a77fdc614851fbb9e97e64911933bc8f8b53e198759e3d634d18e07", "ja": "{$P$}……はい！\nロコは、アートに手を抜いたりしませんからね♪", "zh": "{$P$}……那当然！\nROCO面对Art一定会全力以赴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6505c366a1393150959bbe761b78c2e3c952c06a399a8863e639652e67609aad", "ja": "それで、こいのぼりについては、\n調べられたのか？", "zh": "所以你查到鲤鱼旗的资料了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "42df2433f9a4e6975f5ea0b585981a034ece91824a46b9886b4e38680ba9c5cf", "ja": "オフコースです！　こいのぼりには、チルドレンの\n健康を願う、ペアレンツの思いがこもってるんですよ！", "zh": "Of course！\n鲤鱼旗中蕴含着Parents祈求Children健康的心愿喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "ac055c149bc2e92d5603655f646bf4adba7fd2179eba5537dccfea7fcdb2003d", "ja": "だからポスターのテーマは、元気に空に向かう\nこいのぼりにしようと思って……どうでしょうか？", "zh": "所以ROCO打算把海报Theme定为\n在空中活力四射地飘扬的鲤鱼旗……你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4cee9bc1d82241a97c690cc0e9e24161b1d1db968c3277b8fd577bb063642949", "ja": "なるほど……うん、いいんじゃないか？\nピッタリだと思うよ！", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，感觉还不错啊。\n我觉得非常适合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "d08ccef116ee798d04a42857d92efdbd95364fa605f7e1a3faf53a9ba54c358f", "ja": "サンクスです♪　{$P$}が\nそう言ってくれるなら、間違いありませんね！", "zh": "Thanks♪\n既然{$P$}这么说了，就肯定不会错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "d945fca86f1bef071c43c14fa16a4e472c65a7cd8d5d18c81c6d925f3a375a64", "ja": "トラディショナルでありながら、イノベーティブな\nポスター、楽しみにしててくださいね♪", "zh": "ROCO会做出既Traditional又Innovative的海报，\n敬请期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0104_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0658137147cfd59353ed8ab9a1adf1229dd2c1da495ba4ab19c508d1fc56affc", "ja": "（その後、ロコが制作したこだわりのポスターは、\n地元の人にも喜んでもらえた。やったな、ロコ！）", "zh": "（后来，ROCO精心制作的海报\n也备受在地居民的喜爱，真是太好了，ROCO！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
